          "text": "Eye examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Mild bilateral conjunctival injection and profuse tearing. No ciliary flush, corneal opacity, foreign body seen on gross examination including lid eversion, eyelid oedema, purulent discharge, or photophobia. Extraocular movements full and non-painful."
      }
    },
